<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Your Institute | Coaching Centre Software by HammerByte</title>
    <meta
        name="description"
        content="Your Institute is coaching centre software with one login and four corners — students, staff, admin, and roles. Run batches, fees, courses, and exams under your institute’s own name."
    />
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://hammerbyte.co.in/products/your-institute" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:locale" content="en_IN" />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="HammerByte" />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://hammerbyte.co.in/products/your-institute" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Your Institute | Coaching Centre Software" />
    <meta
        property="og:description"
        content="One login. Four corners. Software for coaching centres — batches, fees, courses, exams, and a public site under your own name."
    />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://hammerbyte.co.in/public/images/hammerbyte-logo.avif" />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="Your Institute | Coaching Centre Software" />
    <meta
        name="twitter:description"
        content="One login. Four corners. Run your coaching centre on Your Institute."
    />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
        href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,500;12..96,700;12..96,800&family=Source+Sans+3:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/products-your-institute.css" />
</head>
<body>
    <header class="yi-top">
        <a class="yi-top-brand" href="/products/your-institute">Your Institute</a>
        <a class="yi-top-cta" href="#inquiry">Request a demo</a>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="yi-hero" aria-label="Your Institute">
            <div class="yi-hero-plane" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="yi-hero-inner">
                <p class="yi-brand" data-reveal>Your Institute</p>
                <h1 class="yi-headline" data-reveal>
                    Run your coaching centre from one login.
                </h1>
                <p class="yi-lede" data-reveal>
                    Four corners for students, staff, admin, and roles — under your institute’s own name.
                </p>
                <div class="yi-hero-actions" data-reveal>
                    <a class="yi-btn yi-btn-primary" href="#inquiry">Request a demo</a>
                    <a class="yi-btn yi-btn-ghost" href="#corners">See the four corners</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="corners" class="yi-section yi-corners">
            <div class="yi-wrap">
                <h2 class="yi-section-title" data-reveal>One login. Four corners.</h2>
                <p class="yi-section-lede" data-reveal>
                    Each person opens only the corner that belongs to them.
                </p>
                <ol class="yi-corner-list">
                    <li class="yi-corner" data-reveal>
                        <span class="yi-corner-index">01</span>
                        <h3>Student</h3>
                        <p>Courses, live classes, self-tests, fees, and calendar.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li class="yi-corner" data-reveal>
                        <span class="yi-corner-index">02</span>
                        <h3>Employee</h3>
                        <p>Users, inquiries, exams, and the day’s tasks.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li class="yi-corner" data-reveal>
                        <span class="yi-corner-index">03</span>
                        <h3>Admin</h3>
                        <p>Branches, revenue, batches, events, and the public site.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li class="yi-corner" data-reveal>
                        <span class="yi-corner-index">04</span>
                        <h3>Developer</h3>
                        <p>Roles and authorities — access given one role at a time.</p>
                    </li>
                </ol>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="yi-section yi-runs">
            <div class="yi-wrap">
                <h2 class="yi-section-title" data-reveal>What your centre runs on</h2>
                <p class="yi-section-lede" data-reveal>
                    The desks behind a coaching institute — named once, used every day.
                </p>
                <ul class="yi-run-list">
                    <li data-reveal>Batches and branch events</li>
                    <li data-reveal>Fees on site and online</li>
                    <li data-reveal>Courses, chapters, video, and PDF</li>
                    <li data-reveal>Self-tests and live examinations</li>
                    <li data-reveal>Revenue and enrolment reports</li>
                    <li data-reveal>A public site in your institute’s name</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="yi-section yi-plans">
            <div class="yi-wrap">
                <h2 class="yi-section-title" data-reveal>One year. Three plans.</h2>
                <p class="yi-section-lede" data-reveal>
                    Coaching centre software, billed once for twelve months. Prices exclude GST.
                </p>
                <div class="yi-plan-row">
                    <article class="yi-plan" data-reveal>
                        <h3>Essential</h3>
                        <p class="yi-plan-price">₹11,999<span>/year</span></p>
                        <p>Profiles, batches, inquiries, fees, basic reports, and a website.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="yi-plan yi-plan-featured" data-reveal>
                        <h3>Professional</h3>
                        <p class="yi-plan-price">₹23,999<span>/year</span></p>
                        <p>Courses, subscriptions, calendar, tasks, and enrolled exams.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="yi-plan" data-reveal>
                        <h3>Enterprise</h3>
                        <p class="yi-plan-price">₹35,999<span>/year</span></p>
                        <p>Recordings, live exams, merit, stream selection, advanced revenue.</p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="inquiry" class="yi-section yi-inquiry">
            <div class="yi-wrap yi-inquiry-wrap">
                <div class="yi-inquiry-copy" data-reveal>
                    <h2 class="yi-section-title">Request a callback</h2>
                    <p class="yi-section-lede">
                        Leave your phone number. We’ll get back on WhatsApp or a call.
                    </p>
                    <p class="yi-inquiry-contact">
                        Or write
                        <a href="https://wa.me/919725837442">+91 97258-37442</a>
                    </p>
                </div>
                <form id="yi-inquiry-form" class="yi-form" novalidate data-reveal>
                    <div class="yi-field">
                        <label for="yi-phone">Phone</label>
                        <input id="yi-phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" required maxlength="13" inputmode="tel" placeholder="10-digit mobile" />
                    </div>
                    <button id="yi-submit" class="yi-btn yi-btn-primary yi-btn-block" type="submit" disabled>
                        Submit inquiry
                    </button>
                    <p id="yi-status" class="yi-status" hidden></p>
                </form>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="yi-footer">
        <div class="yi-wrap yi-footer-inner">
            <p>Your Institute by <a href="/">HammerByte</a></p>
            <p><a href="mailto:support@hammerbyte.co.in">support@hammerbyte.co.in</a></p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="/public/products-your-institute.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
